    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "No. 4 Bellefield Springs is a superb two-storey, three-bedroom semi-detached home, enviably positioned along the entrance to one of Enniscorthy's most sought-after and highly regarded residential developments. Presented in turnkey condition, this attractive property is ready for immediate occupation. Offering generous and well-proportioned accommodation, this property is suited to a wide range of buyers to include first-time buyers, families or anyone simply seeking a quality home in a peaceful and established setting.\nThe property benefits from oil-fired central heating, uPVC double-glazed windows, walls and attic have been re-insulated, attractive Ber rating of B, a modern fully fitted kitchen, generous utility room, three well-sized bedrooms and a beautifully landscaped and private rear garden with convenient side access.\nBellefield Springs is an increasingly mature and beautifully maintained development, renowned for its attractive homes, spacious surroundings and excellent location. The development offers a wonderful sense of privacy while being conveniently situated close to Enniscorthy town centre and all of its associated amenities.\nHomes in Bellefield Springs rarely come to the market and, when they do, they tend to attract strong interest. No. 4 represents an excellent opportunity to acquire a beautifully presented home in a highly desirable location. Early viewing is strongly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nOn entering, you are greeted by a bright and welcoming hallway with tiled flooring and timber staircase leading to the first floor. A guest WC is conveniently positioned beneath the stairs to include whb. \nTo the right is a comfortable and inviting living room featuring laminate flooring and a cosy solid fuel stove with attractive cast-iron and timber surround, as well as french doors leading to the kitchen. The delightful kitchen area features an attractive range of shaker-style fitted units complemented by classic black hardware. The kitchen provides excellent storage and includes a fully tiled floor and tiled backsplash. \nLocated directly off the kitchen is a generous utility room also laid to tile. Access to the rear garden is available directly from the kitchen via sliding doors, as well as through the utility room.\nThe first floor provides three generously proportioned bedrooms, all laid to floor with tongue and groove timber flooring for utmost longevity. \nThe master bedroom is particularly spacious and features built-in wardrobes and a charming half-bay window. The ensuite is fully tiled and includes a shower cubicle with electric shower, WC and whb.\nThe family bathroom is tiled to all wet areas, also with T&G flooring and comprises wc/whb and bathtub with mains shower over.\n\nExternally\nThe property is approached via a paved driveway, complemented by a neatly landscaped front garden with mature trees and greenery leading to the front entrance. Convenient side access is provided to the rear garden via a timber gate.\nTo the rear, the property boasts a superb private and beautifully landscaped garden, completely fenced/walled in, enclosed by mature hedging and established shrubs.\nThe garden features a manicured raised flower bed areas with shrubs and topiary which have been cultivated and meticulously maintained throughout the years, as well as a low maintenance patio area, providing the perfect setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or relaxing during the warmer months. The combination of mature planting and established boundaries creates a wonderful sense of privacy and tranquillity.\n\nKey Features\n•Superb three-bedroom semi-detached home\n•Highly sought-after Bellefield Springs development\n•Spacious and well-appointed accommodation\n•High-quality timber/laminate/tile flooring throughout\n•Oil-fired central heating\n•uPVC double-glazed windows\n•Fully fitted shaker-style kitchen\n•Range of kitchen appliances included\n•Generous utility room with rear door access\n•Three excellent-sized bedrooms\n•Master bedroom with built-in wardrobes and ensuite\n•Private landscaped rear garden\n•Mature hedging and established shrubs\n•Patio area ideal for outdoor entertaining\n•Convenient side access\n•Paved private driveway\n•Excellent location close to Enniscorthy town and amenities\n•Ready for immediate occupation\nNo. 4 Bellefield Springs offers an excellent blend of space, privacy and convenience in one of Enniscorthy's most desirable residential developments. Viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate what this impressive home has to offer.\n\nBER \nB\n\nOverall Size\nc.106 sq. m. approx.\n\nIncluded\nOven, hob, extractor, dishwasher, fridge freezer, washing machine, dryer, light fittings. \n\nServices\nMains water, mains drainage, mains electricity \n\nDirections \nY21 W1X0\nFrom Enniscorthy towards Kiltealy passing Aldi/Lidl, take the next right into Bellefield Springs. The property will be at the front of the development on the left hand side, sign on same."
